Design a circuit that determines the larger of two 4-bit unsigned numbers. The module takes two 4-bit inputs, num1 and num2, and outputs the larger value on the 4-bit output, larger. It utilizes intermediate registers to store the input values and compare them, ultimately providing an output based on the comparison results. If the numbers are equal, it outputs num1, ensuring a consistent result in that case.
