Build a 12-bit binary counter with asynchronous active low reset signal and a preset enable signal. When preset is high, preset the counter with the provided value.
// (1) reset_n: Resets the counter to 12'b000000000000 when low.
// (2) preset: Enables the preset operation when high.
// (3) preset_val: The value to be preset into the counter when preset is high.
// (4) q: The value of the counter.

