Design a hardware block that implements a 32-bit multiplier. This module takes a 32-bit input and performs a series of arithmetic and bit-shift operations to compute the product of the input with a constant value, effectively calculating `i_data0 * 13`. The output is a 32-bit result produced through optimized combinational logic.
